      "controls": {},
      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Circle Points gives Count points round a circle as an X list, a Y list and the Angle of each. Join puts list B after list A, so three Joins make one ring of eight inside one of sixteen, and a Stamp on Points draws a triangle at each, turned by its Angle. The Master Gear turns the inner ring's Start forward and the outer's back. Try each Circle Points' Count and Spread, or its Radius."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
